<title>USA: Associated Banc-Corp sets 6-for-5 split.</title>
<headline>Associated Banc-Corp sets 6-for-5 split.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated Banc-Corp on Wednesday said it approved a six-for-five stock split, to be paid in the form of a 20 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The company also approved a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.29 a share to be paid February 14 to stockholders of record on February 4. The 20 percent stock dividend is payable on March 17 to shareholders of record on March 5.</p>
<p>Associated said it intended to declare a cash payout of $0.29 a share in the 1997 second quarter as well.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
